==== Wave 2: Content

Content for the charter wave: the network of small fields and executive destinations the Challenger 650 serves, and any scenery that makes the IFR world feel real — approach-friendly airports, region packs, and the places a charter captain actually flies into.

One content-layer addition was made at your direction on 2026-08-21 — the library most freeware scenery needs before it will show anything.

#mod-entry(
  "OpenSceneryX",
  url: "https://www.opensceneryx.com",
  deps: none,
  impact: "Shared object library (buildings, vehicles, airport clutter) that many freeware airport and region packs depend on — the prerequisite of the content layer.",
  notes: "Freeware. Run the installer and point it at your X-Plane 12 root; it lives in Custom Scenery/OpenSceneryX. Installed once, needed by scenery added in later waves. Current version: user to provide.",
)
